              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "makiska"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this twice now, and it turned out very tasty! Instead of cajun seasoning I used a mix of Montreal chicken spice and some other stuff I happened to find. The breading texture is wonderful! Here too I made a little change, used kefir instead of buttermilk, which is almost the same, just a bit thicker, because I happened to have in my fridge. I would make almost any white fish with this recipe.",
